exports[`heat panels on the real Esch data (characterization) > renders the map card for 2022 1`] = `"Summer heat, observed by satelliteSurface temperature, not air temperature — morning Landsat pass, ~100m cells.2022202320242025Commune mean33.6°CHottest 10% of cells134 cellsCooler than commune averageHotterSatellite heatLandsat surface temp, 100mVegetation (NDVI)Sentinel-2, 10m sourceSchools & care homesOSM, point locationsPRO-SUD study mapTheir own modelled layer© Administration du Cadastre et de la Topographie / Geoportail.lu for the PRO-SUD layer. Click a square or a pin for detail."`;

